              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kur ipyed wunu nyiŋa ame cil, jo Icrael myero ŋe ni an acil; an a Rwot ame lonyowu ite bedo wunu acil, ",
          "type": "text",
